<title>SRI LANKA: Hatton falls 2.9 pct on lack of buying.</title>
<headline>Hatton falls 2.9 pct on lack of buying.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hatton National Bank Ltd was down 2.9 percent, or eight rupees, on trade of 500 shares on Friday, a day after an announcement that it had made a bid for a stake in Commercial Bank Ltd.</p>
<p>&quot;There are no buyers. Investors have opted to put the share on hold, and wait for the outcome of yesterday's announcement,&quot; said a trader at a foreign joint venture stockbroking firm.</p>
<p>Commercial Bank said on Thursday that Hatton National and Development Finance Corp had expressed interest to buy 40 percent of its issued capital, currently held by Standard Chartered Bank.-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
